Package: argon-oneup-lid
Version: 1.2.5
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GamingTux <gamingtux@users.noreply.github.com>
Recommends: raspi-utils-dt | raspberrypi-utils
Section: hardware
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/argon-oneup-suite
Description: Argon ONE UP Laptop Hardware Lid Switch Integration
 Integrates the physical Hall-effect magnetic lid switch on GPIO 27
 into the standard Linux input subsystem (EV_SW, SW_LID) via a Device Tree Overlay.
 Automatically configures config.txt and activates the overlay at runtime.
